    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect banknotes to survive. Deposit 100 million yen into the ATM to survive. Avoid dangers such as TVs that will kill you if you are seen and dangerous floating objects. Explore while avoiding yellow panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sisters, who have decided to participate in the death game, are wearing the latest collars with built-in sensors around their necks. If the sensor reacts to danger, it goes bang. It's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The floor of the death game venue is a collection of panels. White is a safe zone that does not change color, but is within the range of the sensor. Green is a panel that changes to yellow, where safety and danger are mixed. Panels directly above a floating object will change to yellow. Yellow panels are dangerous. Even the slightest hesitation will kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work was created using Unity.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect banknotes to survive. Deposit 100 million yen into the ATM to survive. Avoid dangers such as TVs that will kill you if you are seen and dangerous floating objects. Explore while avoiding yellow panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sisters, who have decided to participate in the death game, are wearing the latest collars with built-in sensors around their necks. If the sensor reacts to danger, it goes bang. It's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The floor of the death game venue is a collection of panels. White is a safe zone that does not change color, but is within the range of the sensor. Green is a panel that changes to yellow, where safety and danger are mixed. Panels directly above a floating object will change to yellow. Yellow panels are dangerous. Even the slightest hesitation will kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work was created using Unity.</p>",
